	1.Build and source your workspace:
		
		colcon build
		source install/setup.bash

	2.Launch rely on urdf_tutorial

		ros2 launch urdf_tutorial display.launch.py model:=$(ros2 pkg prefix manipulator_3dof)/share/manipulator_3dof/urdf/manipulator_3dof.urdf.xacro

	3.Dedicated display.launch.py for your package so you don’t rely on urdf_tutorial
	
	ros2 launch manipulator_3dof display.launch.py

